HST Office: Header and Footer pages use Word's "Different odd and even pages" and "Different first page".
The two new boxes are the inverse of the "same content" boxes, which stay in a hidden box as the values
every caller reads (svx and sc), so items and page ids do not change.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-dialogs-writer.py header-footer
